{
  "name": "Recruiting Agent 3 - Interview Booked (Cal.com)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Interview Booked\nCal.com calls this webhook when a candidate books, reschedules or cancels. Cal.com creates the Google Calendar event and Meet link itself, so this workflow only updates the Sheet and tells the recruiter.\n\nMatches the booking by `candidate_id` (sent in the booking link), falling back to the attendee's email.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "dd3cc941-f471-411f-a617-a827059ae43d",
      "name": "Note 0",
